## 🎯 Context

SSL pinning blocks your intercept proxy (Burp / mitmproxy / Caido) from seeing TLS traffic, even after installing your CA. This playbook is the operational sequence:

**Escalation order**: Cheapest tooling first → Surgical Frida hooks → Binary patching as last resort

**Real-world stacks covered**:
- NSURLSession + custom `URLSessionDelegate`
- AFNetworking / Alamofire pin sets
- TrustKit
- Custom C/Swift pinning
- Flutter / Xamarin / React Native stacks
- CFNetwork

