## Phase 1 — Recon: Identify the Pinning Implementation

> **Key principle**: Pin bypass is library-specific. Fingerprint first, don't fire generic hooks blindly.

### 1.1 Extract the Binary

**From jailbroken device:**
```bash
frida-ios-dump -l                    # List installed apps
frida-ios-dump com.example.app       # Produces Decrypted.ipa
unzip Decrypted.ipa -d app/
file app/Payload/App.app/App         # Verify Mach-O binary
```

### 1.2 Static Fingerprinting

**Search for pinning identifiers:**
```bash
# Strings scan
strings -a app/Payload/App.app/App | grep -Ei \
  'pin|TrustKit|AFNetworking|AFSecurityPolicy|Alamofire|ServerTrust|TLSPin|publicKeyHashes'

# Class/method dump
class-dump app/Payload/App.app/App > classdump.txt
grep -Ei 'Pinning|TrustEvaluator|ServerTrust|CertificateValidator' classdump.txt

# Embedded certificates & ATS pinning
find app/Payload/App.app -name '*.cer' -o -name '*.der' -o -name '*.crt' -o -name '*.pem'
grep -r 'NSPinnedDomains' app/Payload/App.app/Info.plist
```

### 1.3 Pinning Stack Identification

| Signature Found | Framework | Bypass Tier | Priority |
|---|---|---|---|
| `AFSecurityPolicy`, `AFURLSessionManager` | AFNetworking | SSL Kill Switch 3 | 🟢 Try first |
| `Alamofire`, `ServerTrustManager`, `PublicKeysTrustEvaluator` | Alamofire | Frida hook (C.4) | 🟡 If A fails |
| `TSKPinningValidator`, `TrustKitConfig` | TrustKit | Frida hook (C.2) | 🟡 Specific |
| `NSPinnedDomains` in Info.plist | iOS 14+ ATS native | SSL Kill Switch 3 / plist patch | 🟢 Try first |
| `SecTrustEvaluate(WithError)?` direct calls | Custom CFNetwork | Frida `SecTrust*` hook (C.1) | 🟡 Generic fallback |
| `BoringSSL_Context_set_custom_verify`, `ssl_crypto_x509_session_verify_cert_chain` | Flutter | libflutter.so hook (C.5) | 🔴 Specialized |
| `cronet`, `BoringSSL_SSL_get_peer_cert_chain` | Chromium/Cronet | Cronet hook (C.6) | 🔴 Specialized |
| `_TtC..._URLSessionPinningDelegate` (Swift mangled) | Custom Swift | URLSession hook (C.1) | 🟡 Generic fallback |
| ProGuard, Xamarin, Mono references | Xamarin.iOS | Mono hook (separate playbook) | 🔴 Different approach |

